          "texto": {
            "es": "LA SOMBRA DE LA MUERTE",
            "en": "THE SHADOW OF DEATH"
          },
          "x": 960,
          "y": 180,
          "hasta": 3
        },
        {
          "en": 3.1,
          "texto": {
            "es": "EL ESPÍRITU FALSO",
            "en": "THE FALSE SPIRIT"
          },
          "x": 960,
          "y": 180
        }
      ],
      "frases": [
        {
          "en": "They brought the man into the shadow of death.",
          "es": "Llevaron al hombre a la sombra de la muerte."
        },
        {
          "en": "There they would shape him again, out of earth, water and fire.",
          "es": "Ahí lo iban a formar de nuevo, de tierra, agua y fuego."
        },
        {
          "en": "And out of the spirit that comes from matter.",
          "es": "Y del espíritu que viene de la materia."
        },
        {
          "en": "That spirit is the ignorance of darkness, and desire.",
          "es": "Ese espíritu es la ignorancia de la oscuridad, y el deseo."
        },
        {
          "en": "It is their false spirit.",
          "es": "Es su espíritu falso."
        }
      ]
